ighest in the years shown was 69.8%, in FY2024.","cites":["MSFT.gross.2026","MSFT.revenue.2026","MSFT.gross.2021","MSFT.revenue.2021","MSFT.gross.2024","MSFT.revenue.2024"]},{"topic":"rd","text":"Research and development took 10.7% of revenue in FY2026 ($35.6 billion), against 12.3% in FY2021.","cites":["MSFT.rd.2026","MSFT.revenue.2026","MSFT.rd.2021","MSFT.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"capex","text":"Capital spending was $116 billion in FY2026, 34.9% of revenue; in FY2021 it was $20.6 billion, 12.3%.","cites":["MSFT.capex.2026","MSFT.revenue.2026","MSFT.capex.2021","MSFT.revenue.2021"]},{"topic":"inventory","text":"Inventory at the end of FY2026 was $1.4 billion, about 5 days of cost of revenue. The most in the years shown was about 32 days, at the end of FY2015.","cites":["MSFT.inventory.2026","MSFT.cost.2026","MSFT.inventory.2015","MSFT.cost.2015"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest segment in FY2026 was Productivity and Business Processes: $140 billion, 42% of revenue.","cites":["MSFT.mix.segment.2026.0","MSFT.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2026 was United States: $171 billion, 51% of revenue.","cites":["MSFT.mix.geography.2026.0","MSFT.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2026 was Server Products and Cloud Services: $129 billion, 39% of revenue.","cites":["MSFT.mix.product.2026.0","MSFT.revenue.2026"]}]}}